Standalone winning-ticket redeemer

Usage:
  livepeer-redeemer [flags]
  livepeer-redeemer [command]

Available Commands:
  completion  Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
  help        Help about any command
  migrate     Manage embedded SQL migrations
  redemptions Inspect recipient redemption state or explicitly retry stored transaction bytes

Flags:
  -c, --config string                      Configuration file; empty disables discovery (env: LIVEPEER_REDEEMER_CONFIG) (default "config.toml")
  -n, --network string                     Network name (custom networks require explicit chain settings) (env: LIVEPEER_REDEEMER_NETWORK) (default "arbitrum-one-mainnet")
  -d, --data-dir string                    Component data directory; defaults to ~/.lpData/<network>/<component> (env: LIVEPEER_REDEEMER_DATA_DIR) (default "$HOME/.lpData/arbitrum-one-mainnet/redeemer")
  -l, --listen string                      Ticket submission listener (env: LIVEPEER_REDEEMER_LISTEN) (default "127.0.0.1:8941")
  -m, --metrics-listen string              Metrics and probe listener (env: LIVEPEER_REDEEMER_METRICS_LISTEN) (default "127.0.0.1:8942")
  -a, --account string                     Dedicated redemption wallet; must not be an orchestrator (env: LIVEPEER_REDEEMER_ACCOUNT)
  -r, --redeemer-db string                 Winning-ticket SQLite database (env: LIVEPEER_REDEEMER_REDEEMER_DB, required)
  -k, --keystore-file string               Encrypted geth redemption account JSON file (env: LIVEPEER_REDEEMER_KEYSTORE_FILE)
      --keystore-password-file string      Owner-only file containing exact password bytes (env: LIVEPEER_REDEEMER_KEYSTORE_PASSWORD_FILE)
      --rpc-url-file string                 (env: LIVEPEER_REDEEMER_RPC_URL_FILE)
      --auth-webhook-file string            (env: LIVEPEER_REDEEMER_AUTH_WEBHOOK_FILE)
      --auth-webhook-headers-file string    (env: LIVEPEER_REDEEMER_AUTH_WEBHOOK_HEADERS_FILE)
      --chain-id uint                       (env: LIVEPEER_REDEEMER_CHAIN_ID)
      --controller-address string           (env: LIVEPEER_REDEEMER_CONTROLLER_ADDRESS)
      --redeemer-tx-timeout duration       Transaction inclusion timeout (env: LIVEPEER_REDEEMER_REDEEMER_TX_TIMEOUT) (default 5m0s)
      --redeemer-max-tx-replacements int   Maximum fee replacements per transaction (env: LIVEPEER_REDEEMER_REDEEMER_MAX_TX_REPLACEMENTS) (default 1)
      --redeemer-max-fee-per-gas string    Optional maximum fee in wei per gas (env: LIVEPEER_REDEEMER_REDEEMER_MAX_FEE_PER_GAS)
      --max-pending-tickets int            Maximum unsettled winning tickets (env: LIVEPEER_REDEEMER_MAX_PENDING_TICKETS) (default 100000)
      --max-tickets-per-recipient int      Maximum unsettled tickets per recipient (env: LIVEPEER_REDEEMER_MAX_TICKETS_PER_RECIPIENT) (default 10000)
  -p, --print-config                       Print audited redacted TOML configuration
  -h, --help                               help for livepeer-redeemer
  -v, --version                            version for livepeer-redeemer

Use "livepeer-redeemer [command] --help" for more information about a command.

Environment Variables:
  LIVEPEER_REDEEMER_KEYSTORE_PASSWORD     Keystore decryption password
  LIVEPEER_REDEEMER_RPC_URL
  LIVEPEER_REDEEMER_AUTH_WEBHOOK
  LIVEPEER_REDEEMER_AUTH_WEBHOOK_HEADERS
